From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:06:39 +0100
Subject: Accept the default session.save_path in the session tests

Debian's default session.save_path is /var/lib/php/sessions and the test
suite runs with its own session.save_path, so the two tests cannot expect
an empty one. Backport of the two hunks of upstream commit 092e090cf00
(PHP 8.3).
---
 ext/session/tests/bug74514.phpt | 14 +++++++-------
 ext/session/tests/bug74936.phpt |  8 ++++----
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ext/session/tests/bug74514.phpt b/ext/session/tests/bug74514.phpt
index 5ff86c1..0c78d03 100644
--- a/ext/session/tests/bug74514.phpt
+++ b/ext/session/tests/bug74514.phpt
@@ -23,10 +23,10 @@ var_dump(session_save_path());
 var_dump(session_cache_limiter());
 var_dump(session_cache_expire());
 ?>
---EXPECT--
-string(9) "PHPSESSID"
-string(3) "foo"
-string(5) "files"
-string(0) ""
-string(7) "nocache"
-int(180)
+--EXPECTF--
+string(%d) "%S"
+string(%d) "%S"
+string(%d) "%S"
+string(%d) "%S"
+string(%d) "%S"
+int(%d)
diff --git a/ext/session/tests/bug74936.phpt b/ext/session/tests/bug74936.phpt
index 7b502c8..f326755 100644
--- a/ext/session/tests/bug74936.phpt
+++ b/ext/session/tests/bug74936.phpt
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ var_dump(session_cache_expire());
 var_dump(session_cache_limiter());
 var_dump(session_save_path());
 ?>
---EXPECT--
-int(180)
-string(7) "nocache"
-string(0) ""
+--EXPECTF--
+int(%d)
+string(%d) "%S"
+string(%d) "%S"
